{
  "uid": "wow-live-map",
  "title": "WoW \u2014 Mapa ao Vivo",
  "tags": [
    "wow",
    "wow-server",
    "trinitycore",
    "homelab"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "15s",
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Mapa ao vivo",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "efnf4d4t8vsw0a"
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# [Abrir console ao vivo \u2192](http://192.168.1.64:9400)\n\nO console mostra, numa s\u00f3 p\u00e1gina: mapa interativo com cada jogador online\n(cor de classe, seletor de zona), lista de jogadores, chat p\u00fablico ao vivo\n(aba Chat) e um painel de inspe\u00e7\u00e3o de personagem (clique num nome ou\nmarcador). Atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o a cada 5 segundos.\n\nAbaixo, os mesmos dados como m\u00e9tricas no Grafana (sem o mapa de fundo \u2014\npara isso, use o link acima)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Jogadores online",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "efnf4d4t8vsw0a"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "wow_players_online",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "efnf4d4t8vsw0a"
          }
        }
      ],
      "unit": "short",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
